Licenses for the vendored TypeScript syntax assets in this folder
(TypeScript.sublime-syntax, TypeScriptReact.sublime-syntax).

Both grammars are MIT licensed. Each syntax file header records the exact
upstream commits and blob SHAs these copies were taken from.

